Package: ubuntuguard
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-yaml, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Ubuntu security baseline audit and reversible hardening CLI
 UbuntuGuard collects host information, runs a 40-rule security baseline,
 plans and applies reversible hardening through drop-in configuration files,
 detects login and integrity anomalies, monitors host health and manages
 configuration backups with checksum verification.
